xtap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/645a25a323fd8d19d1de8ad5/1a75cb9c-d018-4fab-82c7-36ec591e7a31_Screenshot2023-05-09174435.png)](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/645a25a323fd8d19d1de8ad5/1a75cb9c-d018-4fab-82c7-36ec591e7a31_Screenshot2023-05-09174435.png)\n\n###### Flat Configuration\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\nBalcony\n\nEnclosed Balcony\n\nTerrace\n\nDry Area\n\nTotal Carpet Area\n\n* [Unit Details](#stackViewTab)\n\n### 1004\n\nNo of BHK\n\n### 1004\n\nFlat No\n\n### sqft\n\nArea\n\n---\n\nPlease Login to Check Latest Transactions\n\n#### Property Listings of Dotom Isle\n\nShow only* For Rent\n* For Sale\n\n---\n\n## Property Listing in this Project\n\nBuy Rent\n\nNo data Found\n\nNo data Found\n\n---\n\n# Dotom Isle – Your Dream Home, Backed by Trusted Financial Partners!\n\nDotom Isle has become a preferred choice for homebuyers, with numerous flats sold to happy owners. These homeowners have been supported by some of India’s most reliable banks and housing finance companies (HFCs), providing a seamless and secure home loan experience.\n\n## About Dotom Isle\n\nDotom Isle is a residential project located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Dotom Realty, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers highly affordable apartments with different configurations, including 1, 2, 2.5 & 3 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 19,200. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 1 BHK are in the... Read More\n\nDotom Isle is a residential project located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Dotom Realty, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers highly affordable apartments with different configurations, including 1, 2, 2.5 & 3 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 19,200. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 1 BHK are in the range of 377 - 424 sqft. The area of 2 BHK are in the range of 572 - 782 sqft. The area of 2.5 BHK is 717 sqft. The area of 3 BHK is 984 sqft. A 1 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 72.2 lakhs. A 2 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 1.1 Crs. A 2.5 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 1.4 Crs. A 3 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 1.9 Crs.\n\nThe prime location of Dotom Isle is a significant advantage for prospective homebuyers, as it is positioned in one of Mumbai's most desirable neighbourhoods. Kandivali West, an already well-developed area, provides excellent connectivity to the rest of the city. The project enjoys close proximity to major roads, railway stations, metro stations, and bus stations, resulting in reduced commuting time for office-goers. Additionally, the neighbourhood offers abundant options for retail shopping and fulfilling daily needs.\n\nOverall, Dotom Isle is an exceptional residential project that ensures a comfortable living experience for its residents through its top-notch amenities and outstanding location.\n\n---\n\n##### More info about Dotom Isle\n\n* About Locality\n* Investments\n\nKandivali in Mumbai is a well-developed locality with a variety of amenities available within a reasonable distance. Connectivity is extremely effortless thanks to the Western Express Highway, S.V. Road and the Kandivali Railway Station.\n\nThere are numerous healthcare facilities, educational institutions and shopping complexes that are in the vicinity to ensure a comfortable living:\n\n**Healthcare Facilities:**\n\n* Zenith Hospital\n* Mangal Murti Hospital\n\n**Educational Institutions:**\n\n* Atharva College of Engineering\n* Ryan International School\n* Billabong International School\n* Don Bosco High School\n\n**Shopping Complexes:**\n\n* Infinity Mall\n* Oberoi Mall\n* Inorbit Mall\n\n**Sports Club**\n\n* Sachin Tendulkar Club\n* Goregaon Sports Club\n\nKandivali is a rapidly developing area in Mumbai that has observed a surge in real estate investments in recent years. It is well-connected to the rest of the city and other suburbs and offers a range of residential and commercial properties at relatively affordable prices. Additionally, the area has seen significant infrastructural development, with improved road connectivity, upcoming metro projects, and other amenities being added. Thanks to the Western Express Highway, the connectivity to prominent business districts such as Vikhroli, Goregaon and BKC is seamless. This is one of the many reasons why Kandivali is a popular residential market. This is why the future of real estate investments is looking bright in Kandivali.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/645a25a323fd8d19d1de8ad5/67aaf7ee-693b-4a47-9d36-ff61cecf28c2_Screenshot2023-05-09174326.png)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* Similar Properties\n* Nearby Properties\n* More properties by Dotom Realty\n\n[![Vastu Darshan Heights-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/64085ab02a441574ebe9796d/92e2621f-e6af-4085-b741-884f042f2ff9_elevationdarshan.png)\n\n#### Vastu Darshan Heights\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\nStudio, 1 & 2 BHK Flats\n\n47 L-1.1 Cr](/properties/details/vastu-darshan-developers/dahisar-west/vastu-darshan-heights/64085ab02a441574ebe9796d)\n\n[![Samarth Reva-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/636265ce831fdd6844dbdbcb/8a9b0af0-f871-4f75-8347-77da1a0e5cb2_Screenshot2023-05-22160525.png)\n\n#### Samarth Reva\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n1 & 2 BHK Flats\n\n70 L-99 L](/properties/details/samarth-group/malad-west/samarth-reva/636265ce831fdd6844dbdbcb)\n\n[![Dimple 73 East-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/632054afa9e86cc9c32b2af5/b0bbd106-220e-467d-83e7-dcbae04ecb06_Screen