https://www.indextap.com/property-for-sale/Mumbai/Kandivali-West), Mumbai.\n\n##\n\nThe developer of Dotom Isle is [Dotom Realty](https://www.indextap.com/property-for-sale/Mumbai/Dotom-Realty).\n\n##\n\nThere are 2 towers/wings in Dotom Isle.\n\n##\n\nThe other projects by this developer are , , , .\n\n##\n\nDifferent configurations available in Dotom Isle are 1, 2, 2.5 & 3 BHK.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 1 BHK in Dotom Isle are in the range of 377 - 424 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe price of 1 BHK in Dotom Isle is in the range of Rs 40,20,000 - 92,66,667.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 2 BHK in Dotom Isle are in the range of 572 - 782 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe price of 2 BHK in Dotom Isle is in the range of Rs 85,76,190 - 1,82,95,238.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 2.5 BHK in Dotom Isle is 717 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe price of 2.5 BHK in Dotom Isle is in the range of Rs 1,06,04,762 - 1,40,82,381.\n\n##\n\nThe area of 3 BHK in Dotom Isle is 984 sqft.\n\n##\n\nThe price of 3 BHK in Dotom Isle is in the range of Rs 1,34,00,000 - 2,01,00,000.\n\n---\n\n#### Area Calculator (Converter)\n\nA land area calculator is a useful tool for converting one unit to another. Land measurements vary across India. If you want to find the equivalent unit of the local term for the unit, the simplest method is to use a land calculator.\n\n* [Square Feet to Gaj Converter](/site/sqft-to-gaj-converter)\n* [Millimeters to Feet Converter](/site/millimeters-to-feet-converter)\n* [CM to Inches Converter](/site/cm-to-inches-converter)\n* [Cent to Square Feet Converter](/site/cent-to-square-feet-converter)\n* [Meter to Centimeter Converter](/site/meter-to-centimeter-converter)\n* [Feet to Centimeter Converter](/site/feet-to-cm-converter)\n* [CM to Feet Converter](/site/cm-to-feet-converter)\n* [MM to Inches Converter](/site/mm-to-inches-converter)\n* [Inches to CM Converter](/site/inches-to-cm-converter)\n* [Inches to Feet Converter](/site/inches-to-feet-converter)\n* [Decimal to Square Feet Converter](/site/decimal-to-square-feet-converter)\n*