 | 1,2 BHK Flats, Shop |\n| Emerald Dotom Isle Status | Under Construction |\n| Emerald Dotom Isle Launch Date | 01 January 2026 |\n| Emerald Dotom Isle Possession Date | 01 December 2030 |\n| Towers in Emerald Dotom Isle | 2 |\n\n### Emerald Dotom Isle Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Emerald Dotom Isle 1 BHK Flat | 415 Sq. Ft. |\n| Emerald Dotom Isle 1 BHK Flat | 383 Sq. Ft. |\n| Emerald Dotom Isle 2 BHK Flat | 586 Sq. Ft. |\n| Emerald Dotom Isle 2 BHK Flat | 604 Sq. Ft. |\n\n### How is the Kandivali West Real Estate Market?\n\n## Ratings & Reviews for Kandivali West\n\n![map image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"map image\")\n\n## Landmarks near Emerald Dotom Isle\n\n## Price Trend for Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n| Locality | Apr-June'26 | Jan-Mar'26 | Oct-Dec'25 | Jul-Sept'25 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 20774 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 20279 / sq.ft6% | ₹ 19054 / sq.ft-3% | ₹ 19693 / sq.ft-6% |\n| Malad | ₹ 22014 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 21898 / sq.ft4% | ₹ 21117 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 21064 / sq.ft-3% |\n| Mahatama Gandhi Road | ₹ 23131 / sq.ft-1% | ₹ 23293 / sq.ft-5% | ₹ 24526 / sq.ft3% | ₹ 23806 / sq.ft-48% |\n\n## Emerald Dotom Isle Photos & Videos\n\n![Project View in Emerald Dotom Isle](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Emerald Dotom Isle\")\n![Project View in Emerald Dotom Isle](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Emerald Dotom Isle\")\n![Project View in Emerald Dotom Isle](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Emerald Dotom Isle\")\n\n## About [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Kandivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kandivali West\")\n\n## About Dotom MV Group\n\n![Dotom MV Group](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Dotom MV Group\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Welcome to world of DOTOM MV GROUP. Here we, as we unveil our new logo and brand identity, a symbol of our evolution, growth, and unwavering commitment to excellence. As DOTOM MV GROUP moves forward into 