rain Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule\")\n![Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility\")\n![The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region\")\n![Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More\")\n![Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know\")\n![John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More\")","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dotom-isle/113728/project","title":"Dotom Isle, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.02 Cr Onwards | 1, 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"# Dotom Isle Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Dotom Realty developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/dotom-realty-9512-6095.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n![Dotom Isle Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dotom-isle-project-project-large-image1-1068.jpg?aio=w-520;h-260;crop;)\n![Dotom Isle Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dotom-isle-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Dotom Isle Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dotom-isle-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.02 Cr - 2.44 Cr**\n\n₹24,900 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Dotom Isle?\n\n## About Dotom Isle, Malad West by Dotom Realty\n\nThis residential property, Dotom Isle, is a haven for those seeking a tranquil and convenient stay at Malad West. Set amidst a thriving neighborhood, the property is strategically located near New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, and Western Express Highway, ensuring a hassle-free commute to various destinations. With a wide range of unit options available, you can choose the perfect home that suits your lifestyle. Whether you are a young professional or a growing family, our units are thoughtfully designed to provide you with the perfect blend of comfort and space.\n\nThe project, Dotom Isle, is a meticulously planned residential complex that offers an array of amenities to enhance your living experience. From power backup to sports facilities, we have taken care of every detail to ensure that you have a comfortable and secure living space. With our Sports amenities, including a well-equipped gymnasium, you can stay fit and active, while our Convenience amenities ensure that you have access to essential facilities. Whether youre a fitness enthusiast or a busy professional, our amenities are designed to cater to your needs.\n\nTo learn more about Dotom Isle, residents can download our comprehensive project knowledge document, available at the link https://doc.squareyards.com/ProjectKnowledge/Brochure\\_3ac60c80f0e142b4add2bb6e33f7e717.pdf. This document provides detailed information about the project, including its specifications and amenities. For instance, our master bedrooms feature walls painted with oil bound distemper for a refined finish. Our attention to detail is evident in every aspect of the project, ensuring that you have a comfortable and enjoyable living experience.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Dotom Isle:\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) |\n| 1 BHK Apartment | 377 Sq. Ft. |\n| 1 BHK Apartment | 398 Sq. Ft. |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 572 Sq. Ft. |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 772 Sq. Ft. |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 984 Sq. Ft. |\n\nThe residential property is strategically located near several notable landmarks, providing residents with easy access to essential amenities and services. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also offer a unique blend of convenience and comfort.\n\nRecent government-registered transactions in the residential property market have generated significant attention, with a notable increase in sales transactions over the past year. During the 3-month aggregation, the sales transactions stood at 7, with a combined gross sales value of 6 Cr., indicating a moderate pace of activity in the market. The 6-month aggregation witnessed a considerable spike in sales transactions, with 16 registered deals valued at 14 Cr. Interestingly, the 1-year aggregation recorded the highest number of sales transactions, with 51 deals closing at a gross sales value of 43 Cr. Although the current rate for residential properties has remained steady at 28,635, the year-over-year price movement reveals a - 1,416 depreciation, while the 6-month decline amounts to - 891. The steady rental rate of N/A indicates a stable demand for residential spaces in the area.\n\n## Dotom Isle Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Dotom Isle.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  413 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.02 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  424 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.05 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  572 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.42 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  772 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.91 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  984 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.44 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| Retail Shop  220 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nDotom Isle's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Dotom Isle | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 24900 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 23300 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 23050 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 21750 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nDotom Isle avg. price is ₹ 24.9 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Paradigm Ananda Park](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-ananda-park/157970/project \"Paradigm Ananda Park\") | ₹ 31,600 |\n| [Paradigm Ananda Phase 2](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-ananda-phase-2/102126/project \"Paradigm Ananda Phase 2\") | ₹ 31,550 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n| [Paradigm Revive](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-revive/107077/project \"Paradigm Revive\") | ₹ 28,050 |\n| Current Project **Dotom Isle** | ₹ 24,900 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Dotom Isle ranges from ₹ 32.9 K to ₹ 72 K with options available for 1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Dotom Isle | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | ₹ 32.9 K | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 45.8 K | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 72 K | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Dotom Isle.\n\nA total of 14 residential transactions has been registered so far for Dotom Isle, amounting to ₹ 15 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Dotom Isle ranges from ₹ 35 K to ₹ 81 K with options available for 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Dotom Isle moved from ₹ 23,300/sqft to ₹ 24,900/sqft, reflecting a 6.87% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Dotom Isle moved from ₹ 23,050/sqft to ₹ 23,300/sqft, reflecting a 1.08% rise.\n\nA total of 88 out of 93 launched units have been booked as of February 2026, including 97% of 1 BHK(30 out of 31 units), 91% of 2 BHK(41 out of 45 units), 100% of SHOP(5 units), 3 BHK(12 units).\n\nA total of 126 out of 183 launched units have been booked as of February 2026, including 45% of SHOP(5 out of 11 units), 75% of 1 BHK(79 out of 105 units), 63% of 2 BHK(42 out of 67 units).\n\nA new Phase, Tower/Building Name: EMERALD - DOTOM ISLE, launched under RERA No. PR1183032502034. with targeted completion by 31-Dec-2030.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n14 Sales Transactions Registered in Dotom Isle From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 18.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 14 | ₹ 15 Cr | ₹ 18,250 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Dotom Isle Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 413 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dotom Isle, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dotom-isle-apartment-1-bhk-377sqft-20245013175021-3d-6243.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 1 BHK 413 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 1.02 Cr**\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 424 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dotom Isle, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dotom-isle-apartment-1-bhk-398sqft-20245013175030-3d-9338.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 1 BHK 424 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 1.05 Cr**\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 572 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dotom Isle, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dotom-isle-apartment-2-bhk-717sqft-20211427141448-3d-7634.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 2 BHK 572 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 1.42 Cr**\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 772 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dotom Isle, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dotom-isle-apartment-2-bhk-772sqft-20245013175039-3d-1672.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 2 BHK 772 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 1.91 Cr**\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 984 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dotom Isle, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dotom-isle-apartment-3-bhk-984sqft-20245013175045-3d-1486.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 3 BHK 984 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 2.44 Cr**\n\n### 220 Sq. Ft. Retail Shop\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **Price on Request**\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Dotom Isle\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Dotom Isle to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Dotom Isle Master Plan 1](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dotom-isle-project-master-plan-image1.jpg?aio=w-370;h-366;crop;)\n![Dotom Isle Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dotom-isle-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Dotom Isle Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dotom-isle-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Dotom Isle Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dotom-isle-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n### Master Plan 1\n\nDotom Isle, located in Malad West, is a master-planned development that is designed to be built in phases. The plan shows areas designated for Phase 1, Phase 2, and Phase 3 development, indicating a comprehensive and evolving residential project.\n\nThe master plan allocates significant space for residential structures, marked as various wings, alongside a large central podium dedicated entirely to amenity and landscape spaces. The perimeter of the property is defined by public roads, and there are areas marked for 'Existing Development' and 'Future Development' that integrate with the overall design.\n\nDownload brochure, master plan & walkthrough video of Dotom Isle to explore floor plans, layout, and complete project details in Malad West, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Expert Review\n\n![Malad West ! 2 bhk ! 3 bhk ! Call 8268515555 ! Dotom isle ! Mumbai](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vS7-1iiwGbc/hqdefault.jpg)\n![1BHK 2BHK & 3BHK DOTOM ISLE MALAD WEST MUMBAI #propertyplazabikashbarnwal](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LhGWEsUdAX4/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Mumbai | Dotom Isle by Dotom Realty at Malad West | MapFlagged](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/22oCk9tilQM/hqdefault.jpg)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Dotom Isle\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-danceroo-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Dotom Realty Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Dotom Isle.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Dotom Isle](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dotom-isle-project-project-large-image1-1068.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Kangaroo Kids Education\n\n#### Bhumi Complex\n\n#### Malvani- Malad Municipal Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malad West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nBypass Road development & proposed highway\n\nAbsence of well developed public transport\n\nAndheri West appeals to me because my interactions are practical and lively. I have great colleges nearby, simple metro access, corporate offices etc. Weekends are spent at parks with family as well as at the beach. Though I adore this location, parking problems and noise have to be addressed quickly.\n\n— Smita Deo, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Dotom Isle\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n14 Sales Transactions Registered in Dotom Isle From Oct 