ipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Dheeraj Oneness](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dheeraj-oneness/8551/project \"Dheeraj Oneness\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Dotom Isle Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Dotom Isle located at Malad West Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nDotom Isle's prime location and full-fledged amenities render it a top pick for clients on the lookout for updated living in Malad West.\n\nOwner\n\nMy mother likes the spacious flats and others facilities.The location's is a significant advantage.\n\nOwner\n\nI experience enjoyable living. The facilities, particularly the gym and swimming pool, add to our way of life.\n\nTenant\n\nI am impressed by this project. But the pricing seems high relative to comparable projects in the are\n\nOwner\n\nI booked a unit by December 2024, but the construction progress seems slower than anticipated.\n\n## Dotom Realty Track Record\n\n![Dotom Realty logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/dotom-realty-9512-6095.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nDotom Realty, a premium real estate developer, is renowned throughout the bustling city of Mumbai. Their towering structures can be seen gracing the city skyline, a testament to their success and unmatched reputation. With a portfolio boasting a total of five projects, Dotom Realty is committed to delivering real estate ventures of the highest caliber.Prospective homeowners seeking a luxurious and grand living experience need look no further. Dotom Realty has an array of ongoing and upcoming residential projects in desirable locations like Vikhroli, Matunga, Borivali, and Khar. These projects feature spacious and lavish flats that redefine the concept of elegance and style.Founded more than two decades ago, the company was established by the partnership of two esteemed architectural experts, Ar. Manoj Vishwakarma and Ar. Ketan Musale. Their architecture firm, DOT Architects, excelled in designing projects that showcased impressive craftsmanship and a commitment to providing homes that exceeded all expectations.With an extensive background in the industry and an impeccable eye for detail, Dotom Realty has seamlessly taken over the realm of real estate. Collaborating with over 200 projects, including villas, commercial spaces, and residential developments, the company prides itself on delivering superior results within specified timelines.Dotom Realty continues to set benchmarks, raising the bar for creativity and precision in every endeavor. Possessing an unwavering dedication to their discerning clientele, their ventures are characterized by meticulous planning and unrivaled levels of artistry. With Dotom Realty, homeowners can anticipate a lifestyle that mirrors international standards, all while receiving the warmth and commitment of a trusted brand.Daring to dream big and arming themselves with years of experience and expertise, Dotom Realty is an unequivocal inspiration. In their pursuit of building homes not hopes, their captivating creations have captured the hearts and imaginations of those fortunate enough to be a part of their world.\n\n![Dotom Jewel residential project in Ghatkopar East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dotom-jewel-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGhatkopar East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.39 Cr to 5.32 Cr\n\n![Dotom Hilton residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dotom-hilton-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.25 Cr to 3.59 Cr\n\n![Shakti Enclave Phase 2 residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shakti-enclave