ages/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-regalia-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.59 Cr to 3.62 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Residency residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-adarsh-residency-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Dotom Isle\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Dotom Isle, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Vijay ravi Gajla  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Immanuel  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Shorap Anil Tiwari  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Shorap Anil Tiwari  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Shorap Anil Tiwari  profile picture]()\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Maa sheetala properties  profile picture]()\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![ASHISH  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![ISHWAR CHAUDHARY  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK + Store Room Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK + Extra Room Apartment For Rent in Dotom Isle in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Mangesh Sadanlal Pal  profile picture]()\n![Nikhil Mahesh Talsaniya]()\n\nThane\n\n![Mangesh Sadanlal Pal]()\n\nHomebase Property Consultant\n\n![Priyanka Gupta]()\n\nVaibhav Realtors\n\n![Shorap Anil Tiwari]()\n\nAuranest Realty\n\nMumbai\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Dotom Isle\n\n### What are the main highlights of Dotom Isle?\n\nDotom Isle features strategic location near New Link Road, easy access to Western Express Highway, a well-designed structure with power backup, and a gymnasium for residents.\n\n### How many units can residents find in Dotom Isle?\n\nDotom Isle offers a total of five different unit configurations, catering to a variety of buyer preferences.\n\n### Can you tell me about the developer behind Dotom Isle?\n\nDotom Isle is developed by Dotom Realty, which has a portfolio of eight successful projects in the real estate market.\n\n### Is Dotom Isle RERA-registered?\n\nYes, Dotom Isle is RERA-registered with the registration numbers P51800013105, P51800031765, and P51800051190.\n\n### What is the construction status of Dotom Isle?\n\nThe construction status of Dotom Isle is partially ready to move, allowing residents to potentially occupy their homes soon.\n\n### What amenities can residents expect at Dotom Isle?\n\nDotom Isle offers a range of amenities including a gymnasium, 24 x 7 security, power backup, a dance room, and rainwater harvesting systems.\n\n### What are the configurations available in Dotom Isle?\n\nDotom Isle has 1 BHK (377–398 sq. ft.), 2 BHK (572–772 sq. ft.), and 3 BHK (984 sq. ft.) apartments.\n\n### What facilities are offered?\n\nFacilities are a gymnasium, swimming pool, badminton, tennis, and squash courts, jogging track, clubhouse, children's play area, and so on.\n\n### What are the surrounding landmarks?\n\nSurrounding landmarks are Billabong High International School, Yashasvi Hospital, and Radhakrishna Restaurant.\n\n### What is the price range?\n\nThe prices vary between ₹95.60 Lac and ₹2.50 Cr, based on the configuration.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/home-loan.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/valuation.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/sell-or-rent-property.png)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n![Lodha](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg)\n![Kalpataru](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg)\n![Hiranandani](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/hiranandani-451.jpg)\n![Runwal](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg)\n![Rustomjee](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg)\n![Mayfair Housing](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mayfair-housing-585.jpg)\n![Godrej](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/godrej-49-2414.jpg)\n![Chandak](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/chandak-1050.jpg)\n![Mahindra Lifespaces](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg)\n![Shapoorji Pallonji](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/shapoorji-pallonji-494.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Vian](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-vian-project-project-large-image1-5543-opt-460392f9-2d11-4a1c-b830-fba5e810b682.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Ahana](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-ahana-project-project-large-image1-4621-opt-3fdf8c3f-c784-42fd-b0f5-4398c6901234.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Purva Estrella](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/purva-estrella-project-project-large-image1-3989-opt-3a6c3ad5-4526-45bf-b146-a3e451ce03ed.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Adani Linkbay Residences](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/adani-linkbay-residences-project-project-large-image1-2560.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Rainforest](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-rainforest-project-project-large-image1-5108-opt-1de55a7d-9847-4c14-bd04-8125e6d5a57d.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Meadows](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-meadows-project-project-large-image1-8749-opt-0576b543-8352-4304-ab97-6c63b05f3057.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![GHP Mars Suncity](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ghp-mars-suncity-project-project-large-image1-7362.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Bliss](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-bliss-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Elixir Reserve](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-elixir-reserve-project-project-large-image1-6960.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![voice search]()\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_emerald-dotom-isle-phase-3-malad-west_8187.html","title":"Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3 Malad West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | PropertyCrow.com","raw_content":"![PropertyCrow.com](/propertycrow-logo-sm.svg)\n\n1. [New Projects](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n›2. [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n›3. [New Projects in Malad West](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_new-projects-in-malad-west_1_1_0_0_116.html)\n›4. [Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_emerald-dotom-isle-phase-3-malad-west_8187.html)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36928.jpeg)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36928.jpeg)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36929.jpeg)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36930.jpeg)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36931.jpeg)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36932.jpeg)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36931.jpeg)\n\n![Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/photo-36932.jpeg)\n\nby DOTOM MV Group\n\n# Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3\n\nJankalyan Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 1 BHK, 2 BHK Flats\n\nSize Carpet Area: 386 Sq.ft - 633 Sq.ft\n\nPrice ₹90 Lakhs Onwards\n\nCall Now +917977640320\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow8187\n\nPossession Status New Launch - Possession Around December 2030\n\nRERA PR1183032502034  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## EMERALD DOTOM ISLE PHASE 3\n\nEmerald Dotom Isle Phase 3 by DOTOM MV Group is a thoughtfully planned residential development nestled in the well-established neighbourhood of Jankalyan Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai. Registered under RERA No. PR1183032502034, this project is designed for modern urban families seeking comfort, connectivity, and long-term value in one of Mumbai’s\n\nsteadily growing residential corridors. Offering intelligently designed 1 BHK and 2 BHK homes, the development focuses on efficient layouts, natural ventilation, and practical living spaces that support both everyday routines and aspirational lifestyles.  \n  \nLocated in the heart of Malad West, Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3 enjoys seamless access to key commercial hubs, social infrastructure, and transportation networks. Jankalyan Nagar is known for its peaceful residential character while being closely connected to Link Road and the Western Express Highway, making daily commuting smooth and convenient. The surrounding area is dotted with reputed schools, healthcare facilities, shopping destinations, and entertainment zones, ensuring that every essential need is just minutes away. Whether it’s work in Mindspace or leisure outings in Malad and Kandivali, residents benefit from a location that keeps them close to everything that matters.  \n  \nThe project is built with a strong emphasis on essential infrastructure and community well-being. A 24×7 water supply system ensures uninterrupted daily comfort, while advanced fire safety systems with compliant sprinkler provisions enhance resident security. The presence of a well-designed storm water drainage system reflects thoughtful planning for monsoon readiness. Internal roads and paved footpaths within the development promote easy movement and a structured layout. A dedicated electrical meter room ensures organised power infrastructure, and the on-site sewage treatment plant demonstrates a commitment to responsible waste water management and sustainable living practices.  \n  \nEmerald Dotom Isle Phase 3 blends functionality with reliability, offering homes that are practical, secure, and future-ready. With its strategic Malad West address, dependable infrastructure, and focus on essential community amenities, the project stands as a smart choice for homebuyers seeking connectivity, convenience, and long-term growth potential in Mumbai’s western suburbs.  \n  \n**Configuration**  \n1 BHK WITHOUT DECK  \nCarpet Area : 386 Sq.ft, 393 Sq.ft, 416 Sq.ft  \n  \n1 BHK WITH DECK  \nCarpet Area : 414 Sq.ft  \n  \n2 BHK WITHOUT DECK  \nCarpet Area : 585 Sq.ft - 605 Sq.ft  \n  \n2 BHK WITH DECK  \nCarpet Area : 611 Sq.ft, 633 Sq.ft\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | Carpet 386 Sq.ft | 90.00 Lacs |\n| 1 BHK | Carpet 393 Sq.ft | 91.64 Lacs |\n| 1 BHK | Carpet 414 Sq.ft | 96.53 Lacs |\n| 1 BHK | Carpet 416 Sq.ft | 97.00 Lacs |\n| 2 BHK | Carpet 585 Sq.ft | 1.36 CR |\n| 2 BHK | Carpet 605 Sq.ft | 1.41 CR |\n| 2 BHK | Carpet 611 Sq.ft | 1.42 CR |\n| 2 BHK | Carpet 633 Sq.ft | 1.48 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n**Utility & Community Amenities**  \n  \n24×7 Water Supply — continuous water availability for residents.  \n  \nFire Safety Systems (sprinklers & compliant systems).  \n  \nStorm Water Drainage System — efficient rainwater drainage infrastructure.  \n  \nInternal Roads & Footpaths — paved surfaces within project layout.  \n  \nElectrical Meter Room — dedicated space for electrical infrastructure.  \n  \nSewage Treatment Plant (STP) — on-site facility for waste water management.\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n**Structure & Flooring**  \nRCC framed structure with vitrified / PGVT tiled flooring in living spaces.  \nAnti-skid tiles in bathrooms and balcony areas.  \n  \n**Doors & Windows**  \nPowder-coated aluminium windows with durable framing.  \nWell-finished wooden door frames for rooms.  \n  \n**Electrical & Safety**  \nConcealed copper wiring with modular switches.  \nProvision for AC points, exhaust fans, and water purifier connections.  \n  \n**Kitchen & Bathroom**  \nGranite/stone kitchen platform with branded sink.  \nFull-height ceramic tiling in bathrooms, branded CP fittings (e.g., Jaquar or equivalent).\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8187/qrau_3123.png)\n\n**RERA No:** PR1183032502034\n\n**Developer:** DOTOM MV Group\n\n**Project:** Emerald Dotom Isle Phase 3\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Jankalyan Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Jankalyan Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Link Road, Western Express Highway, Mindspace Malad, Kandivali West, Charkop\n\n#### Schools\n\nVibgyor High School Malad, Ryan International School Malad, Atharva College of Engineering\n\n#### Hospitals\n\nZenith Multispeciality Hospital, Lifeline Multispeciality Hospital, Oscar Hospital\n\n#### Restaurants\n\nBarbeque Nation Malad, Urban Tadka Malad, Mainland China Malad\n\n#### Bank/ATMs\n\nHDFC Bank Malad West, ICICI Bank Malad West, State Bank of India Malad West\n\n#### Bus Stop\n\nJankalyan Nagar Bus Stop, Malad Station Bus Stop, Charkop Bus Depot\n\n#### Metro/Railway\n\nMalad Railway Station, Kandivali Railway Station, Lower Malad Metro Station\n\n#### Airport\n\nChhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport, Mumbai Domestic Airport, Juhu Aerodrome\n\n#### Petrol Pumps\n\nIndian Oil Link Road, Bharat Petroleum Malad West, Hindustan Petroleum Kandivali\n\n#### Shopping Mall\n\nInfinity Mall Malad, Inorbit Mall Malad, Growel€™s 101 Mall\n\n#### Parks\n\nMindspace Garden, Jankalyan Nagar Garden, Aksa Beach\n\n#### Place of Worship\n\nEvershine Nagar Ganesh Mandir, Our Lady of Lourdes Church Malad, Ayyappa Temple Malad\n\n#### Groceries\n\nD-Mart Malad West, Reliance Smart Malad, Nature€™s Basket Malad\n\n#### Movie Theaters\n\nPVR Inorbit Mall, INOX Infinity Mall, Carnival Cinemas Malad\n\n#### Police Station\n\nMalad Police Station, Bangur N